<title>UK: Zeneca falls as Bayer rules out takover.</title>
<headline>Zeneca falls as Bayer rules out takover.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Zeneca Group tumbled after German chemicals and drugs group Bayer AG said ruled out a bid for the UK pharmaceutical firm, saying it is too expensive, traders said.</p>
<p>At 1122 GMT, Zeneca's shares were off 22p to 1532-1/2p.</p>
